Our story is about the compound "SIMPLE SECURE VPC" 

First, if you want to build a compound, what is the first step?!

True, it's the land. You should find a piece of land to build on, which represents the "Provider". 
Here, we tell AWS that we want to build our compound in the us-east-1 region.

The second step is to build the wall to prevent anyone from getting in or out without our permission.
We use a "VPC" like a wall for our compound, and its area is defined by cidr_block = "10.0.0.0/16". 
We can use a funny name like "The great wall of VPC".

Third, the parts of the compound are the "Subnets". 
The compound is very large, so we will divide it into parts by making the cidr blocks smaller and faster.
and divide the people by there role like the owner,citizens and the  guestes . 
I want the people in the compound to be able to get out, so I will give them the ID of the gate.
But wait, where is the gate?!

Fourth, "The gate" -> "Internet Gateway".
At this moment, our compound is completely closed off by the "VPC". 
So, we will build a gate in the wall to connect to the internet.

Fifth, there is no system for moving around or doing anything?!
To solve this, we will construct a map to prevent any problems.
After that, we will make a copy for every street to ensure the people ("Users") don't get lost
